        <div class="quick-links-card">
            <div class="quick-links-card-details">
                <div class='title'><h3>Enhancing Contract Negotiations with LLM-Based Legal Document Comparison</h3>
</div>
                <div class='description'>
                    <p><span class="accented-text"><span class="body-medium">October 2024</span></span></p>
<p>This approach is the first in the literature to produce a natural language comparison between legal contracts and their template documents.</p>
</div>
            </div>

            
                
    <a aria-label="Enhancing Contract Negotiations with LLM-Based Legal Document Comparison, opens in new tab" class="link" data-cmp-clickable data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;event&#34;:&#34;cmp:click&#34;,&#34;webInteraction&#34;:{&#34;ctaType&#34;:&#34;link&#34;,&#34;ctaText&#34;:&#34;Read more&#34;,&#34;ctaUrl&#34;:&#34;https://aclanthology.org/2024.nllp-1.11/&#34;,&#34;ctaTitle&#34;:&#34;Enhancing Contract Negotiations with LLM-Based Legal Document Comparison&#34;,&#34;ctaComponentName&#34;:&#34;Quick Links&#34;}}" href="https://aclanthology.org/2024.nllp-1.11/" target="_blank">
        <span class="link-text">Read more</span>

        
            
  
  
